---
import { metaAdsSetup as service } from '../../data/meta-ads-setup';
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---
<section class="section visual-lesson" aria-labelledby="lesson-title">
  <div class="wrap visual-lesson-layout">
    <div class="visual-lesson-copy">
      <p class="section-label">03 <span>操作説明とガイド</span></p>
      <h2 id="lesson-title"><span>管理画面を見ながら、</span><span>基本操作を一緒に。</span></h2>
      <p class="lesson-lead">配信状況や数字の見方、予算変更、停止・再開。実際の画面を共有して、操作する場所と手順をご説明します。</p>
      <div class="visual-lesson-time"><strong>{service.lectureMinutes}<small>分</small></strong><p><span>オンライン・画面共有</span>基本操作の説明と質疑応答</p></div>
      <p class="lesson-supporting">基本操作の確認と質疑応答も含みます。<br/>後から振り返れる共通の操作ガイド付き。</p>
      <p class="lesson-limit">納品後の継続サポートは含まれません。</p>
    </div>

    <figure class="lesson-demonstration">
      <div class="lesson-window">
        <div class="lesson-window-header"><span>広告管理画面</span><small>操作画面のイメージ</small></div>
        <div class="lesson-window-body">
          <div class="lesson-demo-row">
            <span class="lesson-demo-icon"><Icon name="eye"/></span>
            <div class="lesson-demo-detail"><h3><span>01</span> 見る</h3><p>配信状況・広告費・クリック</p>
              <div class="demo-table" aria-hidden="true"><span><i></i><b></b><b></b></span><span><i></i><b></b><b></b></span></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="lesson-demo-row">
            <span class="lesson-demo-icon"><Icon name="sliders"/></span>
            <div class="lesson-demo-detail"><h3><span>02</span> 変更する</h3><p>予算設定の場所と変更手順</p>
              <div class="demo-budget" aria-hidden="true"><span class="budget-line"><i></i></span><Icon name="sliders"/></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="lesson-demo-row">
            <span class="lesson-demo-icon"><Icon name="pause"/></span>
            <div class="lesson-demo-detail"><h3><span>03</span> 止める・再開する</h3><p>配信を切り替える操作</p>
              <div class="demo-switches" aria-hidden="true"><span class="demo-toggle off"><i></i></span><span class="switch-arrow">↔</span><span class="demo-toggle on"><i></i></span></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="lesson-guide-visual"><span class="guide-book" aria-hidden="true"><Icon name="guide"/></span><div><small>説明の後は</small><strong>共通ガイドで振り返り</strong><p>予算変更・停止と再開・数字の確認</p></div></div>
      <figcaption>説明用に構成したイメージです。実際の画面とは異なります。</figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .visual-lesson{background:#fff;color:#152536}
  .visual-lesson-layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:80px;align-items:center}
  .visual-lesson .section-label{color:#235c91}
  .visual-lesson h2{font-size:clamp(1.65rem,2.5vw,2.25rem);line-height:1.65;letter-spacing:.015em;overflow-wrap:normal}
  .visual-lesson h2>span{display:inline-block;max-width:100%}
  .lesson-lead{margin-top:24px;font-size:1rem;line-height:2;color:#596570;max-width:32em}
  .visual-lesson-time{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:24px;margin:29px 0 23px;padding-block:22px;border-top:1px solid #d2d7d8;border-bottom:1px solid #d2d7d8}
  .visual-lesson-time p{font-size:.875rem;color:#596570;line-height:1.8}
  .visual-lesson-time p>span{display:block;font-size:.875rem;color:#152536;font-weight:550;margin-bottom:3px}
  .visual-lesson-time strong{font-size:3.5rem;font-weight:450;letter-spacing:-.04em;line-height:1;flex-shrink:0;color:#235c91;font-variant-numeric:lining-nums}
  .visual-lesson-time small{font-size:1rem;margin-left:8px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0}
  .lesson-supporting{font-size:.9375rem;line-height:1.9;color:#152536}
  .lesson-limit{font-size:.875rem;line-height:1.8;margin-top:17px;color:#596570}
  .lesson-demonstration{min-width:0;margin:0}
  .lesson-window{border:1px solid #bbc5cb;background:#f9f9f7;color:#152536}
  .lesson-window-header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px 20px;padding:17px 23px;border-bottom:1px solid #cdd4d8;font-size:.875rem;font-weight:550;flex-wrap:wrap}
  .lesson-window-header small{font-size:.875rem;font-weight:400;color:#596570}
  .lesson-window-body{padding:3px 25px}
  .lesson-demo-row{display:flex;gap:20px;padding:23px 0;align-items:flex-start}
  .lesson-demo-row+.lesson-demo-row{border-top:1px solid #d5dcdf}
  .lesson-demo-icon{width:26px;height:30px;flex:0 0 26px;display:grid;place-items:center;color:#235c91;margin-top:2px}
  .lesson-demo-icon :global(svg){width:25px;height:25px;stroke-width:1.4}
  .lesson-demo-detail{flex:1;min-width:0}
  .lesson-demo-detail h3{font-size:1rem;font-weight:600;line-height:1.6}
  .lesson-demo-detail h3>span{font-size:.875rem;color:#667d8e;margin-right:9px;font-weight:450}
  .lesson-demo-detail p{font-size:.875rem;line-height:1.8;color:#596570;margin-top:3px}
  .demo-table{margin-top:13px;border-block:1px solid #ced8dd;padding:5px 0;max-width:280px}
  .demo-table>span{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.6fr 1fr 1fr;gap:16px;padding:6px 0}
  .demo-table>span+span{border-top:1px solid #e3e7e8}
  .demo-table i,.demo-table b{height:4px;background:#bdc9cf}
  .demo-table i{background:#6c8fa5;width:80%}
  .demo-table b:last-child{width:65%}
  .demo-budget{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;margin-top:16px;max-width:280px}
  .budget-line{height:3px;flex:1;background:#d3dde1;position:relative}
  .budget-line:before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0 40% 0 0;background:#6c8fa5}
  .budget-line i{position:absolute;top:-4px;left:58%;width:11px;height:11px;background:#f9f9f7;border:2px solid #235c91;border-radius:50%}
  .demo-budget :global(svg){color:#235c91;width:21px;height:21px;stroke-width:1.3}
  .demo-switches{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:15px;margin-top:14px}
  .demo-toggle{display:flex;align-items:center;padding:3px;width:38px;height:21px;border-radius:14px;background:#c7d1d6}
  .demo-toggle i{width:15px;height:15px;border-radius:50%;background:#fff}
  .demo-toggle.on{background:#235c91;justify-content:flex-end}
  .switch-arrow{font-size:1.125rem;color:#7a8c98}
  .lesson-guide-visual{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:17px;padding-top:23px;margin-top:0}
  .guide-book{display:grid;place-items:center;color:#235c91;flex:0 0 35px}
  .guide-book :global(svg){width:35px;height:35px;stroke-width:1.2}
  .lesson-guide-visual small{display:block;font-size:.875rem;color:#596570}
  .lesson-guide-visual strong{font-size:1rem;font-weight:550;line-height:1.8;display:block}
  .lesson-guide-visual p{font-size:.875rem;color:#596570;line-height:1.8;margin-top:2px}
  .lesson-demonstration figcaption{font-size:.875rem;line-height:1.8;color:#596570;margin-top:20px}
  @media(max-width:1050px){.visual-lesson-layout{gap:40px}.visual-lesson h2{font-size:1.8rem}.lesson-window-header{padding-inline:18px}.lesson-window-body{padding-inline:20px}.lesson-demo-row{gap:16px}}
  @media(max-width:800px){.visual-lesson-layout{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);gap:35px}.visual-lesson-copy{max-width:650px}.lesson-demonstration{max-width:650px;width:100%}.lesson-window-body{padding-inline:27px}.lesson-demo-row{gap:22px}.demo-table,.demo-budget{max-width:350px}.visual-lesson-time{max-width:480px}}
  @media(max-width:480px){.visual-lesson h2{font-size:1.625rem}.lesson-lead{font-size:.9375rem;margin-top:19px}.visual-lesson-time{gap:20px;margin-block:23px;padding-block:20px}.visual-lesson-time strong{font-size:3rem}.lesson-window-body{padding-inline:17px}.lesson-demo-row{gap:14px;padding-block:21px}.lesson-demo-icon{width:22px;flex-basis:22px}.lesson-demo-icon :global(svg){width:22px;height:22px}.lesson-window-header{gap:5px 12px;padding:14px 17px}.lesson-demo-detail h3{font-size:.9375rem}.lesson-demo-detail h3>span{margin-right:5px}.lesson-guide-visual{gap:14px}.guide-book{flex-basis:31px}.guide-book :global(svg){width:31px;height:31px}}
</style>
